<title>UK: Banco Sabadell sets 20 bln peseta step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Banco Sabadell sets 20 bln peseta step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead managers J.P. Morgan, Madrid.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO SABADELL</p>
<p> AMT    20 BLN PTA    COUPON     *6.06     MATURITY    31.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE    31.JUL.97</p>
<p>FULL FEES  25 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST THREE YEARS THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>		 STEPS-UP TO 6.70 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p> LISTING    AIAF	DENOMS (M)  25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
